{% icon id="wheelbarrow" size=32 /%}Feed a castle that needs building material. The Send resources by cart {% term id="module" %}module{% /term %} sends wood, stone or food from one of your castles to the castle at the X and Y you give, by market cart. It sends load after load until the total you set has gone.

{% terms_on_page /%}

It is not an attack {% term id="plugin" %}plugin{% /term %}, so it does not count toward your {% term id="attack-cap" %}attack cap{% /term %}.

## How it works {% #how-it-works %}

1. A few minutes after your bot signs in, it reads the carts and goods of every castle's marketplace.
2. For each row, it checks that a castle, an {% term id="outpost" %}outpost{% /term %} or a capital stands at the target. It never sends to an empty spot or to anything else.
3. It fills every free cart of the sending castle, but never sends more than the row still has to send.
4. When the carts reach the target, the game says how long their way home takes. The next load leaves 10 seconds after they are home.
5. When a row has sent its total, it is done. The status says so, and no more carts go for that row.

A cart carries about 100 of a resource, more with the castle's cart bonuses. The bot learns the real load from each send. After a load that fills every cart, the next load tries one more per cart, until the game refuses one. Then the bot knows the load and keeps to it.

## Write your sends {% #rows %}

**Sends** is a table. Choose **Add row** and fill in every column:

- **Castle** is the castle that sends.
- **Target X** and **Target Y** are the map position of the castle that takes the goods. It must be in the same {% term id="kingdom" %}kingdom{% /term %} as the sending castle.
- **Resource** is wood, stone or food.
- **Send in all** is the total the row sends.
- **Castle keeps** is how much of the resource the sending castle always keeps.

The bot sends only a full load: every free cart filled, or the rest of the total. If the castle holds less than that above **Castle keeps**, it waits and looks again 10 minutes later.

Two rows from one castle share its carts. A second row with the same castle, target and resource as another row is not used.

{% aside type="note" id="send-resources-count" %}
The bot counts what each row has sent, and the count survives a restart. To send more, raise **Send in all**: the row sends the difference. Removing a row forgets its count, so a row added again starts from nothing. The bot never changes the rows you saved.
{% /aside %}

## Horses {% #horses %}

With **Ride the fastest horse paid with coins** on, the carts ride the fastest market horse the castle's stables have that costs coins. A {% term id="coin-horse" %}coin horse{% /term %} costs coins on every send. Turn the setting off and the carts walk.

## Test with Log only {% #log-only %}

Turn on **Log only: write the sends to the log instead of sending them**. The bot plans each load and writes it to the {% term id="log" %}log{% /term %}, but sends nothing and counts nothing.

## What it never does {% #never %}

- It never spends {% term id="ruby" %}rubies{% /term %}, and never rides a horse that costs them.
- It never takes a castle below **Castle keeps**.
- It never sends more than the row's total.
- It never sends to a spot where no castle, outpost or capital stands.
- It never starts carts within 5 to 10 seconds of another army leaving, so two armies never start close together.

## Read the status {% #status %}

The {% ui key="client:module.status" /%} card tells you what the plugin did last:

- **Sent** an amount to a target, and how much of the row's total has gone.
- **Carts are out** to a target. The next load leaves 10 seconds after they are home.
- **Sent all** of a row's total. That row is done.
- **Every row has sent its total.** Raise a total or add a row to send more.
- **The castle doesn't hold a full load** above what it keeps. It looks again in 10 minutes.
- **Every cart of the castle is out.** It looks again in a minute.
- **Nothing at** the target can take resources. Check **Target X** and **Target Y**.
- **A sending castle has no marketplace**, so it has no carts.
- **A castle in your rows isn't on this account**, or isn't known yet.
- **The game refused a send.** It tries again in 10 minutes.
- **No send is set up.** Add a row.

