## Not yet checked in the game {% #live-check %}

How a send works comes from another bot's code and from the game's own client. Two things still need a check in the game: the exact load one cart takes on your account, and how the game refuses a load that is too big. Send one small load on a spare account before you rely on it. Food has not been sent by this bot in the game yet.

## Related errors {% #errors %}

- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ROW](/errors/#plugin-option-row): a row of a table is not complete.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_CHOICE](/errors/#plugin-option-choice): a row's resource is not one of the choices.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_RANGE](/errors/#plugin-option-range): a number in a row is out of range.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ROWS](/errors/#plugin-option-rows): a table has too many rows.
